<view class="detail-page safe-bottom"><view class="detail-header"><view class="back-button" bindtap="back">‹</view><text class="page-title">患者详情</text></view><view class="hero"><view class="avatar">{{patient.initial}}</view><view><view class="hero-name">{{patient.name}}</view><view class="hero-meta">{{patient.genderLabel}}　{{patient.ageLabel}}</view><view class="hero-meta">编号：{{patient.patientCode}}</view></view></view><view class="info-grid card"><view><text>出生日期</text><text>{{patient.birthDate || '未填写'}}</text></view><view><text>文化程度</text><text>{{patient.profile.educationLevel || '未填写'}}</text></view><view><text>职业</text><text>{{patient.profile.occupation || '未填写'}}</text></view><view><text>婚姻状况</text><text>{{patient.profile.maritalStatus || '未填写'}}</text></view><view><text>既往病史</text><text>{{patient.profile.medicalHistoryText || '无'}}</text></view><view><text>过敏史</text><text>{{patient.profile.allergyHistory || '无'}}</text></view></view><view class="card status-card">
    <view class="section-title">近一月测评状态</view>
    <view class="status-badge {{statusClass}}">{{statusText}}</view>
    <view class="muted">统计近30天内六项量表的完成情况</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:for="{{trendData}}" wx:key="scaleCode" class="card trend-card">
    <view class="trend-title">{{item.scaleCode}}得分趋势</view>
    <canvas id="trend-{{item.scaleCode}}" type="2d" class="trend-canvas"></canvas>
    <view class="trend-analysis">趋势分析：{{item.analysis}}</view>
  </view><view wx:if="{{completedCount === 6}}" class="card radar-card"><view class="section-title">六项测评能力概览</view><view class="radar-wrap"><canvas id="radar" type="2d" class="radar"></canvas></view><view class="radar-note">以上为最新六项测评结果的标准化展示</view></view>
  <view class="card history"><view class="section-title">历史测评</view><view wx:if="{{records.length === 0}}" class="muted empty">暂无测评记录</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="assessmentId" class="record"><text>{{item.scaleCode}}</text><text>{{item.createdAt}}</text><text class="record-score">{{item.scoreSummary.totalScore === null ? '待评分' : item.scoreSummary.totalScore + '分'}}</text></view></view><view class="card doctor-advice"><view class="section-title">医生建议</view><view class="doctor-note">请由医生根据患者实际访谈、既往病史、受教育程度和本次六项测评结果填写专业建议。系统不会自动生成或替代医生意见。</view></view><button wx:if="{{completedCount === 6}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="viewComprehensive">导出测评报告</button><button class="primary-button" bindtap="startAssessment">发起新测评</button></view>
